# Indev 20100223 -> Alpha 1.1.2_01 Feather names, for the Classic Bots (see tools/Remap.java for the format).
# Only what the bots use. Found with javap against the game jar; Indev is Alpha's direct ancestor, so most members
# have an Alpha twin. What Indev lacks (or keeps as float where Alpha has double) is a STUB, filled in by
# bots/indev/.../Compat.java.

